				129,
				1
			],
			"Message": "chore(Project): Synchronize Element submodules for terminal persistence and dependency updates\n\nAdvance the Element submodule from b0d4545a to a433ff65, integrating terminal layout state persistence, native color scheme caching, and dependency alignment across Cocoon, Mountain, Output, and Sky.\n\nKey modifications:\n- **Mountain**: Wire `localPty:getTerminalLayoutInfo` and `setTerminalLayoutInfo` to `StorageProvider` to restore active terminal tabs and dimensions after window reloads. Cache native color scheme detection in a `OnceLock` to eliminate repeated OS syscalls during boot.\n- **Cocoon**: Update `@types/node` to 25.9.1 and `protobufjs` to 8.4.0 via Dependabot.\n- **Output**: Normalize case-statement indentation in `Run.sh` and `prepublishOnly.sh` to consistent 0-tab/1-tab formatting.\n- **Sky**: Bump `@astrojs/ts-plugin` to 1.10.9 and `astro` to 6.3.5 via Dependabot.\n\nThese changes ensure terminal state survives workbench reloads, reduce startup latency, and align all dependencies with upstream releases.",
			"SHA": "289329062931b417680b41819b25b7b5981f8086"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-19T21:45:46Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				129,
				1
			],
			"Message": "chore(Project): Synchronize Element submodule for language provider dispatch and handler deduplication\n\nAdvance the Element submodule from ba4e373c to b0d4545a, pulling in Cocoon language provider wiring, Mountain notification handler consolidation, and Output script formatting fixes.\n\nKey modifications across components:\n- **Cocoon**: Wire six new `$provide*` dispatch methods into the InvokeLanguageProvider handler table — `$provideInlineCompletion`, `$provideInlineEdit`, `$provideMultiDocumentHighlight`, `$provideMappedEdits`, `$provideDocumentPasteEdit`, and `$provideDocumentDropEdit`. This extends coverage from 17 to 23 handled `$provide` methods, closing the round-trip for all 6 Mountain RPC language provider registrations added upstream.\n- **Mountain**: Collapse 16 near-duplicate Cocoon-to-Mountain notification handlers into 2 shared helpers under a new `Support/` submodule — `RelayToSky` (generic Tauri sky:// event emitter, replaces 11 handlers) and `UnregisterByHandle` (generic provider handle deregistration, replaces 6 handlers). Reduces net code by 164 lines with zero behavioural change.\n- **Output**: Normalize case-statement indentation in `Run.sh` and `prepublishOnly.sh` from mixed tabs/spaces to consistent 0-tab indent. Whitespace only, no functional change.\n\nAlso includes an empty marker commit (b0d4545a) with no file changes or message.",
